00:07:27.447 --> 00:07:32.702
A true urban courtyard,

00:07:32.702 --> 00:07:49.385
food.

00:07:50.970 --> 00:07:51.387
Yeah,

00:07:52.638 --> 00:08:01.314
yeah, yeah.

00:08:05.151 --> 00:08:05.902
This is the project

00:08:05.902 --> 00:08:09.155
